{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The Blink bundle feels like a useful next purchase because a doorbell and extra cameras could expand the coverage of my existing Blink setup, provided they are compatible.",
    "The Fire TV Stick fits my history of television streaming, and the larger Echo Show has some appeal as a display, although neither gives me a strong reason to buy now."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The gaming bundle adds a gaming purpose that my television and streaming purchases do not suggest I want.",
    "Smart speakers, voice-controlled lighting, and a tablet do not address my current interest in camera coverage and television viewing simply because they connect to Alexa."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat my Fire TV purchases as interest in almost any Amazon or Alexa device.",
    "They seem to assume another streaming device is useful because I bought one before, even though I already have a 4K Stick and a Fire TV television."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "An addition that serves a new purpose, such as doorbell coverage, matters more to me than another device that repeats something my setup already does.",
    "My camera purchases make practical security expansion relevant, but compatibility with my existing equipment matters before I would choose a bundle."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations recognize my streaming and camera interests but stretch them into broad Alexa interest without enough attention to a specific new use."
}"}
